QtFrotz - A Kobo interpreter for all Infocom games and other Z-machine games
based on Frotz V2.43

KDE port written by Peter Bienstman <Peter.Bienstman@UGent.be>, based on code
by David Griffith and others. (See AUTHORS file for more details.)

## Building for Kobo E-Readers

For detailed instructions on how to build QtFrotz for Kobo devices 
(including Kobo Libra Colour with Firmware 4.44+), see [BUILD.md](BUILD.md).

Quick start:
```bash
./build-kobo.sh     # Cross-compile for Kobo
./deploy-kobo.sh /media/$USER/KOBOeReader  # Deploy to Kobo
```

Requirements:
- koxtoolchain (ARM cross-compiler)
- Qt 5.15.x for Kobo
- NickelMenu (for app launching)

